Jaffar E Taiyar Da Bachra, <br>
Puttar Nu Ay Samjha Vey<br>
Ro Ro Sabaq Parha Vey<br>
<br>
Aun Bachra Aey Yaad Rakheen, Shabbir Da Dard Vandave'n<br>
<br>
Ro Ro Abdullah Aakhey, <br>
Jad Jang Da Vela Aa Vey <br>
Akber Tu Pahly Jaave'en <br>
<br>
Jis Seenrh Da Puttar Mai Waali Han, Us Seenrh Di Aey Manshah Aey, <br>
Tenu Sadqa Veer To Laway, O Panj Meel Da Raqba Honrey, <br>
Karbal Tu'n Bahar Ja Kay, Tu Puttar Zameen Tay Aaveen<br>
<br>
Teri Maa Day Ser Di Chaadar Vi, Qabay Da Paak Ghilaaf Aey<br>
Odha Kar Kay Puttar Taowafay, Fhir Paak Imam Dy Dar Tey<br>
Tazeem Da Sajda Kar Kay, Tu'n Ezan Jihaad Da Paaveen<br>
<br>
Rakh Yaad Hamaishah Syedda Dy Ghar Di Yeh Reet Purani<br>
Ban Kay Abbas Da Saani, O' Jad Seenrh Sakina Aa Vey<br>
Sawa'an Di Waaj Naa Away, Oday Saamney Sir Naa Chaaveen<br>
<br>
Shabbir Nu Saari Zindagi May, Khud Maula Aakh Bolaya<br>
Raiyat Da Faraz Nibhaya, Aey Adab Tu'n Bhul Na Jaaveen<br>
Sajjad Nu Veer Naa Akhi, Onoh Tu'n Sardaar Bulaaveen<br>
<br>
Aj Puttar Mohammad Kamsin Aey, Rakhi Odah Khaas Khiyaal Ay<br>
Her Qadam Tay Hoveen Naal Aey, Har Vaar Tay Dy Veen Daad Aey<br>
Kavi Raazi Nay Ajdaad Ay, Eenvey Hoosla Deenda Jaaveen<br>
<br>
Tenu Jang Tu'n Pahly Amri Nay, Siffeen Da Haal Suna Nay<br>
Dujaa Abbas Bana Nay, O Kariyeen Vey Nehar Ty Qabza<br>
Ik Khoon Da Chaalda Dariya, Dariya Day Naal Baha Veen<br>
<br>
Tareekh Day Vich Mahfooz Raway, Aey Jung Hay Bachra Teri<br>
Gal Yaad Rakheen Yeh Meri, Tin Din Taeen Piyasa Rah Key<br>
Run Vich Ya Zahra Kah Kay, Mera Chund Talwaar Chalaaveen<br>
<br>
Abdullah Aun Day Naal Akber, Gal Aey Wo Aakhiri Ki Ti<br>
Tere Hath Izzat Aey Meri, O' Jad Sir Katwaanrh Da Vella<br>
Away Wich Karbal Bachra, Meri Jaa'nh Tey Sir Katwaaveen